@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,sans-serif

title 前端状态剩余回合展示流程 — 设计 #38

actor "玩家" as U
participant "App.jsx" as App
participant "api.js" as API
participant "Flask API\ncontroller/api.py" as Flask
participant "GameCore" as GC
participant "GameBoard.jsx" as GB

U -> App: ① 点击 "Next Round"
App -> API: ② getState(gameId)
API -> Flask: ③ GET /api/games/{gameId}
Flask -> GC: ④ get_state()
GC -> GC: ⑤ 构建 PlayerState\n(statuses 含 lifetime)
GC --> Flask: GameState
Flask --> API: players.1.statuses = [("defense", 2)]
API --> App: state
App -> GB: ⑥ 传入 state prop
GB -> GB: ⑦ renderStatusBar()\nstatusTags = s.type + " (" + s.lifetime + ")"

note right of GB
  渲染结果:
  <span class="status-tag tag-defense">
    defense (2)
  </span>
end note

GB --> U: ⑧ 状态栏显示 "defense (2)"

@enduml
